<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Physician Reliance.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Physician Reliance.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities analyst Amy de Rham said she initiated coverage of Physician Reliance Network Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- She said she expects the company to earn $0.53 per share in fiscal 1996 and $0.70 in fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>-- She has a target price of $23 on the stock, about 32 percent above current levels.</p>
<p>-- Physician Reliance Network is the largest oncology practice management company in the U.S.</p>
</text>
